 close a Repeat body, as LANGUAGE.md's termination rule 2 promises. This
 is the one closure path that worked before the fix, so it is the
 regression risk. Here the body has no trailing period; only the blank
 line ends it, so "after" runs once after the loop. Expected: r, r,
 after.)

Repeat 2 times, Print "r"

Print "after".